| 2026-10-05 09:00:05 | system | `divergence_detected` | Filas 3, 4 exceden tolerancia 0.01 |
| 2026-10-05 09:05:12 | maria | `row_adjusted` | Fila 3: `monto_iva` 160.05 → 160.00 |
